---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout locale="en" pageKey="cookies" title="Cookie Settings" description="Allow or withdraw optional analytics in this browser."><main id="konten" class="container-site max-w-4xl py-16"><a href="/en/" class="font-bold underline">Back to guide</a><h1 class="mt-8 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Cookie Settings</h1><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">19 October 2026</p><article class="prose-legal mt-8"><p>Analytics is off by default. Permanent choices use local storage; a tab refusal is also stored for the session. There are no other preference or marketing features.</p><form id="cookie-settings" class="card mt-8 p-6"><label class="cookie-label"><input id="analytics" type="checkbox" /> Allow Google Analytics</label><div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button type="submit" class="rounded-full bg-river px-6 py-3 font-bold text-white">Save choice</button><button data-cookie-reject type="button" class="rounded-full border px-6 py-3 font-bold">Reject / withdraw</button></div><p data-consent-status role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mt-4"></p></form><p class="mt-6">The homepage Google Maps embed is separate and can send technical requests to Google. <a href="/en/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a></p></article></main></BaseLayout>